  "limitations": [
    "The four finite historical logs are historical executions, not fresh behavioral executions by this reviewer.",
    "Accepted restic/native cryptographic bounds and OS race limitations remain; no security certification or universal parity claim.",
    "Fixture cleanup validates own lexical temporary parent/prefix, not atomic filesystem isolation against a hostile process. Setup failures before after-hook installation can leave a synthetic owned temporary folder.",
    "Process-local fs/Date.now hooks are restored in finally; per-file child test execution isolates them. This does not exercise every real kernel failure or signal boundary.",
